  ],
  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\magma.element:of{M ::= (X, *)}]\nDeclares: x \"in\" X\nwhen: M is \\magma\nEnables:\n. capability: x_ [*] y_ :=> x_ |M.*| y_\n  written: \"x_? *? y_?\"\nDocumented:\n. called: \"element of magma $M?$\"\n. description: \"An element of a magma $M$ is simply a member of its underlying\n                set. Naming it as its own notion lets the operation of $M$ be\n                written directly between two of its elements as $x * y$.\"\nId: \"d9405849-68a5-4721-9090-42eb0b9775d2\"",
